   "id": 16,
   "video": "wb9qyIQKsYU",
   "t": 360,
   "score": 5,
   "text": "They're charging 134% for a market that obviously only has 100% right cuz 100% of the time it either goes over or under.",
   "me": 1,
   "child": 1
  },
  {
   "id": 18,
   "video": "Cqo4AAeVeuI",
   "t": 39,
   "score": 4,
   "text": "This is their top category, and they trade this at almost a 6% return off of their investment, which means that on NBA money lines, this is the one market",
   "me": 1,
   "child": 1
  },
  {
   "id": 22,
   "video": "wW4VjMHaZf8",
   "t": 753,
   "score": 4,
   "text": "Last year he was 53 %.",
   "me": 1,
   "child": 1
  },
  {
   "id": 28,
   "video": "YkOSnugS_k4",
   "t": 423,
   "score": 4,
   "text": "Baltimore has the seventh highest completion rate allowed there, where Lawrence sends 13% of his throws.",
   "me": 1,
