  },
  {
   "id": 34,
   "video": "Y2YMiG4LCfg",
   "t": 380,
   "score": 5,
   "text": "scoring 4.5 points a game, but also averaging four and a half attempts as well, making 33% of his shots, which is a very good rate, especially from outside the",
   "me": 1,
   "child": 1
  },
  {
   "id": 71,
   "video": "Y2YMiG4LCfg",
   "t": 389,
   "score": 5,
   "text": "Again, Pistons nine out of 30, only allowing 13.4 attempts uh per game, but again, opponent field goal percentage is 35%.",
   "me": 1,
   "child": 1
  },
  {
   "id": 76,
   "video": "wW4VjMHaZf8",
